      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'How it works


    - The FieldPrinter is an autonomous construction layout
    robot that takes BIM/CAD models and prints them full-scale directly on the jobsite
    floor.


    - It navigates around the site using established control points
    and prints lines, symbols, and even text with ~1/16-inch accuracy.


    - Controlled
    via an iPad app and linked to the Dusty Portal software, it ensures that digital
    designs are accurately and consistently transferred to the field.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
